3. NEVER use chained text selectors, including:
   - ">> text="
   - ">> css=... >> text="
   - ":has-text()"

4. For role="option", role="menuitem", role="combobox":
   - You MUST use role=<role>[name="X"]
   - text= is FORBIDDEN for these roles.

5. text= selectors are allowed ONLY when:
   - No ARIA role exists
