7. Native <select> rule (STRICT):
   - For native <select> elements:
     - The ONLY valid selector is:
       role=combobox[name="X"]
     - role=option is FORBIDDEN
     - text= is FORBIDDEN

Return ONLY JSON:
{ "selector": "..." }


